  'Option C (To host private Git repositories) is the primary function of AWS CodeCommit. It is a fully managed source control service that hosts secure, highly scalable private Git repositories. Option A (To automate software deployments) is handled by AWS CodeDeploy. Option B (To build and test code) is handled by AWS CodeBuild. Option D (To orchestrate CI/CD pipelines) is handled by AWS CodePipeline.',
