  'To detect configuration drift, you first select the specific AWS CloudFormation stack you want to analyze (Option D). Once selected, you initiate a drift detection scan on that stack (Option B). After the scan completes, you review the drift detection results (Option A) which will highlight any differences. The final step is to identify the specific resources that have drifted from their template definition (Option C) for potential remediation.',
