  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'The typical and recommended order for top-level sections in a CloudFormation template is: Description, Parameters, Mappings, Conditions, Resources, and Outputs. Option B (Description) provides metadata about the template. Option D (Parameters) allows input values to be passed to the template. Option A (Resources) declares the AWS resources to be created. Option C (Outputs) declares output values that can be imported by other stacks or viewed in the console.',
