  '{0,1,3,2}',
  'To begin with AWS CDK, Option A (Install AWS CDK Toolkit globally) is the first step to get the CLI. Then, Option B (Initialize a new CDK project with ''cdk init'') creates the basic project structure. Before deploying, Option D (Bootstrap the AWS environment for CDK deployment) is often required to provision resources like an S3 bucket for assets. Finally, Option C (Synthesize the CloudFormation template with ''cdk synth'') generates the CloudFormation template from the CDK code.',
