  '["Reference the parameter value using ''Ref'' intrinsic function","Define the parameter in the ''Parameters'' section","Specify a default value or allowed values for the parameter","Provide a descriptive label for the parameter"]'::json,
  '{1,3,2,0}',
  'To use parameters, first, Option B (Define the parameter in the ''Parameters'' section) declares the parameter with a logical ID and type. Then, Option D (Provide a descriptive label for the parameter) enhances usability in the console. Option C (Specify a default value or allowed values for the parameter) sets constraints or initial values. Finally, Option A (Reference the parameter value using ''Ref'' intrinsic function) retrieves the parameter''s runtime value within the ''Resources'' or ''Outputs'' sections.',
