  'To define outputs, Option A (Define the output in the ''Outputs'' section) is the first step, giving it a logical ID. Option C (Optionally add a description for the output) provides context for the output. Option B (Specify the value to be exported or displayed) uses an intrinsic function like `Ref` or `Fn::GetAtt` to specify the actual data. Finally, Option D (Reference the output from another stack using ''Fn::ImportValue'') is how other CloudFormation stacks can consume this output.',
