  '{3,0,1,2}',
  'To deploy a conformance pack, first, Option D (Identify the set of AWS Config rules to include) determines the scope of compliance. Then, Option A (Define the conformance pack template (YAML or JSON)) bundles these rules. Option B (Deploy the conformance pack using the AWS Config console or CLI) provisions the pack. Finally, Option C (Review the compliance dashboard for aggregate results) provides a consolidated view of compliance status.',
