  '["Amazon CodeGuru Reviewer","AWS CodeBuild","AWS CodeDeploy","Amazon S3","AWS Lambda"]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (Amazon CodeGuru Reviewer) is specifically designed for static code analysis, providing intelligent recommendations to improve code quality and identify security vulnerabilities. Option B (AWS CodeBuild) can be configured to run various static analysis tools as part of the build process, integrating them into the pipeline to detect issues. Option C (AWS CodeDeploy) is for deploying applications, not for code quality analysis. Option D (Amazon S3) is for object storage. Option E (AWS Lambda) is a serverless compute service that could run custom analysis, but CodeGuru Reviewer and CodeBuild are more direct and integrated solutions for this task.',
