  'multiple',
  '["Amazon CodeGuru Reviewer.","AWS CodeBuild for executing static analysis tools.","AWS CodeCommit for code quality checks.","AWS Lambda for custom code analysis scripts.","Amazon CloudWatch for monitoring code quality metrics."]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (correct) is specifically designed for automated static code analysis, using machine learning to provide intelligent recommendations for improving code quality and identifying security vulnerabilities. Option B (correct) can be used to execute various static analysis tools (e.g., SonarQube, linters) as part of the build process defined in its `buildspec.yml`, integrating them into the CI/CD pipeline. Option C (incorrect) is a source code repository and does not perform code quality checks itself, though it integrates with services that do. Option D (incorrect) can run custom scripts, but CodeGuru Reviewer is a specialized service for this purpose, and CodeBuild is better suited for integrating general static analysis tools. Option E (incorrect) is a monitoring service and does not perform code analysis.',
  NOW(),
