  'What is the main benefit of using CloudWatch Contributor Insights?',
  'mcq',
  '["It helps identify top N contributors to log data, such as IP addresses, user IDs, or resource IDs, causing issues.","It provides a serverless platform for running custom code in response to operational events.","It enables real-time monitoring of application performance by tracing requests across distributed systems.","It offers a managed service for deploying and scaling OpenSearch clusters for log analytics."]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) describes the main benefit of CloudWatch Contributor Insights, which analyzes log data to show the top N contributors impacting system performance or generating errors, helping to quickly pinpoint root causes. Option B describes AWS Lambda. Option C describes AWS X-Ray. Option D describes Amazon OpenSearch Service.',
