  'Option B (correct) is CloudWatch Dashboards, which allows users to create customizable home pages in the CloudWatch console to monitor resources in a single view, combining metrics, logs, and alarms from various AWS services. Option A is for triggering actions based on thresholds. Option C is for querying logs. Option D is for dynamic thresholding.',
