  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) states that AWS CloudTrail primarily records AWS API calls and related events, providing a history of actions taken within an AWS account. Option A is handled by CloudWatch Logs Agent or similar. Option B is handled by CloudWatch Metrics. Option D is handled by AWS X-Ray.',
