VALUES (
  'q_39_m_39_2_46',
  'A DevOps engineer needs to quickly identify the top N contributors (e.g., IP addresses, user IDs, resource IDs) causing performance issues or errors in application logs. Which CloudWatch feature can help achieve this efficiently?',
  'mcq',
  '["CloudWatch Alarms","CloudWatch Dashboards","CloudWatch Contributor Insights","CloudWatch Logs Insights"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is CloudWatch Contributor Insights, which is designed to analyze log data and identify the top N contributors that are causing issues, such as specific IP addresses, user IDs, or resource IDs. Option A is for alerting on thresholds. Option B is for visualization. Option D is for general log querying but does not specifically highlight top contributors in the same automated way as Contributor Insights.',
