  'Option C (correct) is Amazon CloudWatch Dashboards. It allows users to create customizable dashboards that can combine metrics from various AWS services (EC2, Lambda, custom metrics), log data, and alarms into a single, unified view for operational health monitoring. Option A is for distributed tracing. Option B is for event-driven automation. Option D is for querying CloudTrail audit logs.',
