  'A company requires its CodePipeline artifacts to be replicated to a secondary region for disaster recovery purposes. Order the steps to configure cross-region replication for the Amazon S3 artifact bucket.',
  'ordering',
  '["Enable versioning on both the source and destination S3 buckets.","Create a destination S3 bucket in the secondary AWS Region.","Configure a replication rule on the source S3 bucket, specifying the destination bucket and an IAM role.","Grant the IAM role permissions to replicate objects from the source to the destination bucket."]'::json,
  '{1,0,3,2}',
  'To set up cross-region replication for an S3 artifact bucket, you first need a destination S3 bucket in the secondary region (Option B). Both the source and destination buckets must have versioning enabled (Option A). An IAM role is required to grant S3 permissions for replication, so you must ensure this role has the necessary permissions (Option D). Finally, you configure the replication rule on the source bucket, pointing to the destination and specifying the IAM role (Option C).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain36_8',
  NOW(),
  9,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_36_3',
  'medium'
);

