  '{3,0,2,1}',
  'To manage ECR image lifecycle, you first create a new lifecycle policy (Option D). Within this policy, you define a rule (Option A) that specifies which images to target, such as untagged images. Then, you set the action for this rule (Option C) to expire images and specify how many to retain. Finally, you apply the completed lifecycle policy (Option B) to the desired ECR repository, which will then automatically enforce the rules.',
