  'Securing CodeArtifact access begins with creating the CodeArtifact domain and repository (Option B). Then, to control access at the resource level, attach an IAM resource policy to the CodeArtifact repository (Option D) to explicitly allow access from specific CodeBuild service roles. Next, configure the CodeBuild project''s service role (Option A) with the necessary IAM permissions to interact with CodeArtifact. Finally, update the CodeBuild project''s `buildspec.yml` (Option C) to use the authorization token to access the repository during builds.',
