  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To manage artifact versions in S3 for CodePipeline, you must first enable versioning on the S3 bucket (Option B). This ensures that every new upload creates a new version. Next, push new application artifact versions (Option C) to this S3 bucket. Then, configure the CodePipeline source or build action (Option A) to use this S3 bucket as its artifact store. Finally, CodePipeline will automatically retrieve the latest or specified artifact version (Option D) for processing in subsequent stages.',
