  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To add a manual approval stage, you first add a new stage to your CodePipeline at the specific point where approval is needed (Option A). Within this new stage, you configure it to include a ''Manual approval'' action (Option B). Next, you can optionally specify an Amazon SNS topic for notifications to alert approvers and add comments or instructions (Option C). Finally, you update the CodePipeline to save and apply these changes, integrating the manual approval step into the workflow (Option D).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain36_8',
  NOW(),
  39,
