  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'To add a manual approval to CodePipeline, first add a new stage or insert an approval action into an existing stage (Option C) in your pipeline definition. Next, configure the manual approval action (Option A), including an optional Amazon SNS topic for notifications. Then, grant the designated approvers (Option B) the necessary IAM permissions to approve CodePipeline actions. Finally, deploy a change (Option D) and observe the pipeline pausing at the approval step.',
