  'To perform an in-place deployment with CodeDeploy, you first define the `AppSpec.yml` file (Option B) with appropriate lifecycle hooks for the in-place strategy. Next, create a CodeDeploy application and an in-place deployment group (Option A) targeting your EC2 instance. Then, bundle the application revision and `AppSpec.yml` (Option C) into a deployment package. Finally, initiate the deployment (Option D) of the new revision to the EC2 instance.',
