  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To enable CodeBuild batch builds, first enable the batch build feature (Option B) in the CodeBuild project settings. Next, configure the CodeBuild service role (Option D) with permissions to manage batch builds. Then, define the `buildspec.yml` (Option A) to specify the batch build configuration, including build phases for each batch. Finally, initiate a batch build (Option C), which will execute multiple builds concurrently based on the configuration.',
