  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter) is the correct service. OpsCenter provides a centralized place for operations engineers to diagnose and remediate operational issues across their AWS resources. It aggregates operational work items (OpsItems) from various AWS services. Option A (AWS Systems Manager Session Manager) allows secure remote management of instances. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store) provides secure storage for configuration data and secrets. Option D (AWS Systems Manager Patch Manager) automates the patching process for instances.',
