  'A DevOps team needs to centralize operational issues from various AWS services, such as Amazon CloudWatch alarms and AWS Config non-compliance findings, into a single dashboard for tracking and resolution. Which AWS service is specifically designed for this purpose, providing a central place to view, investigate, and resolve operational work items?',
