  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is AWS Config auto-remediation with SSM Automation runbooks. This feature allows AWS Config to automatically trigger AWS Systems Manager Automation documents (runbooks) to remediate non-compliant resources. This significantly reduces manual effort and ensures consistent compliance. Option A suggests manual remediation, which is an anti-pattern (ap-5.2-001) due to scalability issues. Option B, Conformance Packs, are for auditing and reporting compliance, not for automated remediation. Option D, Config aggregators, are for collecting Config data across multiple accounts and regions, not for remediation.',
