  '{2}',
  'Option C (Amazon Inspector v2) is the correct service. It automates the process of discovering and reporting software vulnerabilities and unintended network exposure for Amazon EC2 instances and container images. Option A (AWS WAF) is a web application firewall that helps protect web applications from common web exploits. Option B (Amazon GuardDuty) is a threat detection service that monitors for malicious activity. Option D (AWS Shield) is a managed Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) protection service.',
