VALUES (
  'q_41_m_41_2_55',
  'A security engineer wants to ensure that all new and existing Amazon EC2 instances are automatically scanned for common vulnerabilities and exposures (CVEs) as part of their continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD) pipeline. Which AWS service should be integrated into the pipeline?',
  'mcq',
  '["AWS CloudTrail","Amazon Inspector v2","AWS IAM Access Analyzer","Amazon GuardDuty"]'::json,
  '{1}',
  'Option B (Amazon Inspector v2) is the appropriate service for this requirement. Inspector v2 provides automated, continuous vulnerability scanning for EC2 instances and container images, making it suitable for integration into CI/CD pipelines to catch vulnerabilities early. Option A (AWS CloudTrail) provides event history for auditing. Option C (AWS IAM Access Analyzer) identifies resources shared with external entities. Option D (Amazon GuardDuty) is for threat detection, not vulnerability scanning of software.',
