  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS Audit Manager) is specifically designed to help prepare for audits. It automates the collection of evidence from your AWS accounts and services, mapping it to controls in various compliance frameworks. This significantly reduces the manual effort required for audit preparation. Option A (AWS Config) assesses resource configurations for compliance but doesn''t automate evidence collection for audit reports. Option B (AWS Security Hub) aggregates security findings and checks against standards but is not primarily an audit evidence collection tool. Option D (AWS CloudTrail) provides activity logs, which are a source of evidence, but it doesn''t organize or map them to compliance frameworks automatically for audit purposes.',
