  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS Secrets Manager) is the correct service for automating the rotation of database credentials and API keys on a regular schedule. This helps reduce the risk associated with long-lived credentials and aligns with security best practices, addressing the anti-pattern of manual rotation. Option A (AWS KMS) manages encryption keys. Option B (AWS IAM) manages user and role permissions. Option D (Amazon CloudWatch) is a monitoring service.',
