  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS IAM Access Analyzer) provides findings on unused access, helping to identify if any IAM roles or users have been granted permissions that are not actively being utilized. This assists in implementing the principle of least privilege. Option A (Amazon GuardDuty) detects threats. Option B (AWS Security Hub) centralizes security findings. Option D (AWS Config) monitors resource configurations.',
