  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Config) is used to detect non-compliant resources based on defined rules. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Automation runbooks) can be directly associated with AWS Config rules to automatically execute predefined scripts or steps to remediate the non-compliant resources. While Option C (Amazon EventBridge) can route Config events and Option D (AWS Lambda) can run custom code for remediation, the combination of AWS Config and SSM Automation runbooks is a direct and integrated solution for executing predefined remediation scripts. Option E (AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager) is for structured incident response, not automated configuration enforcement.',
