  '{1,3}',
  'Option B (Amazon EventBridge) can capture Amazon GuardDuty findings as events and route them to specific targets based on patterns, minimizing custom routing logic. Option D (AWS Lambda) can then be triggered by EventBridge to execute custom code for isolating resources (e.g., modifying security groups) and sending notifications. Option A (AWS Config) is for configuration compliance, not direct security threat response. Option C (AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter) is for tracking operational issues, not for automated remediation execution. Option E (Amazon SNS) is for sending notifications but does not perform resource isolation or complex remediation actions.',
