  '{1,4}',
  'Option B (AWS Config) is ideal for detecting non-compliant S3 bucket policies. Option E (AWS Systems Manager Automation runbooks) can be configured as an auto-remediation action for AWS Config rules, providing pre-built or customizable automation documents to disable public access with minimal custom code. Option A (Amazon SNS) is for notifications, not remediation. Option C (AWS Lambda standalone) would require writing and maintaining custom code for both detection and remediation, increasing operational overhead. Option D (AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter) is for tracking operational issues, not for automated remediation execution.',
