  '{2,3}',
  'Option C (AWS Health) provides personalized information about events that affect your AWS resources, such as scheduled maintenance or service degradations. Option D (Amazon EventBridge) can integrate with AWS Health to capture these events and route them to various targets, such as AWS Lambda functions for automated processing or Amazon SNS for notifications, enabling proactive responses. Option A (Amazon GuardDuty) is a threat detection service. Option B (AWS Lambda) can process events but needs a trigger. Option E (Amazon SNS) is for notifications.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain40_8',
  NOW(),
