  '{0,1,3}',
  'Option A (Amazon EventBridge) can capture events from AWS services like Amazon S3 and route them based on patterns. Option B (AWS Lambda) can be configured as a target for EventBridge rules to process the event with custom code. Option D (Amazon SNS) can also be configured as a target for EventBridge rules to send notifications to subscribed stakeholders. Option C (Amazon SQS) could be a target for EventBridge, but it''s not directly involved in triggering Lambda and sending notifications in this specific scenario. Option E (AWS Health) is for AWS service health events, not general service events like S3 object creation.',
