  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter) provides a central console to aggregate, track, and investigate operational issues (OpsItems). Option B (AWS Systems Manager Automation) allows the creation and execution of custom runbooks to automate the resolution of common operational problems, and these runbooks can be invoked directly from OpsCenter. Option C (Amazon CloudWatch Dashboards) visualizes metrics and logs but doesn''t manage operational issues. Option D (AWS Config) monitors resource configurations. Option E (Amazon SQS) is a message queuing service.',
