  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Lambda) allows you to run custom code (scripts) in response to various events, including security findings (e.g., from GuardDuty via EventBridge) or operational events. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Automation) provides a framework for defining and executing runbooks (Automation documents) that can perform a wide range of operational tasks and remediation actions, often triggered by events or integrated with other services like AWS Config. Option C (Amazon EventBridge) routes events but doesn''t execute scripts itself. Option D (AWS CloudTrail) records API calls. Option E (Amazon S3) is object storage.',
