  'A company is using Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose to deliver logs to Amazon S3 and needs to adjust the buffering hints to optimize delivery for specific log volumes. Order the following steps to modify buffering hints for an existing Firehose delivery stream.',
  'ordering',
  '["Navigate to the Kinesis Data Firehose console and select the target delivery stream.","Modify the buffer size and buffer interval settings.","Save the changes to the delivery stream configuration.","Select the ''Edit'' option for the S3 destination settings."]'::json,
  '{0,3,1,2}',
  'To adjust buffering hints for a Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream, Option A (Navigate to the Kinesis Data Firehose console and select the target delivery stream) is the first step to access the stream. Next, Option D (Select the ''Edit'' option for the S3 destination settings) allows modification of the destination-specific parameters. After that, Option B (Modify the buffer size and buffer interval settings) is where the actual buffering hints are changed. Finally, Option C (Save the changes to the delivery stream configuration) applies the modifications. Attempting to modify settings before selecting the stream and its destination would be out of sequence.',
