  'ordering',
  '["Modify the CloudWatch agent configuration file (`config.json`) to define custom metrics.","Ensure the EC2 instance''s IAM role has `CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy` attached.","Restart the CloudWatch agent service on the EC2 instance.","Verify the custom metrics appear in the CloudWatch console."]'::json,
  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To configure the CloudWatch agent for custom metrics, Option B (Ensure the EC2 instance''s IAM role has `CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy` attached) is a prerequisite for the agent to publish metrics. Next, Option A (Modify the CloudWatch agent configuration file (`config.json`) to define custom metrics) specifies which metrics to collect and how. After configuration, Option C (Restart the CloudWatch agent service on the EC2 instance) applies the new settings. Finally, Option D (Verify the custom metrics appear in the CloudWatch console) confirms successful collection and publication. Attempting to configure or restart without proper permissions would fail.',
