  'A DevOps team is implementing cross-account observability in Amazon CloudWatch to centralize monitoring of metrics, logs, and traces from multiple AWS accounts into a single monitoring account. Arrange the following steps in the correct order to establish this setup.',
  'ordering',
  '["In each source account, create a CloudWatch link to the sink in the monitoring account.","Designate a monitoring account and one or more source accounts.","In the monitoring account, create a CloudWatch sink.","View metrics, logs, and traces from source accounts in the monitoring account''s CloudWatch console."]'::json,
