VALUES (
  'q_41_m_41_3_83',
  'Which two AWS services can help a company automate compliance checks against industry standards and continuously monitor resource configurations for deviations? (Select TWO.)',
  'multiple',
  '["AWS Config","AWS Security Hub","AWS Audit Manager","Amazon GuardDuty","Amazon Macie"]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Config) continuously monitors and records your AWS resource configurations and allows you to automate the evaluation of recorded configurations against desired configurations. Option B (AWS Security Hub) aggregates security findings and can check your environment against security industry standards and best practices, including compliance standards like CIS Benchmarks and PCI DSS. While AWS Audit Manager (Option C) automates audit evidence collection, AWS Config and Security Hub are more focused on continuous monitoring and compliance checks against standards. Option D (Amazon GuardDuty) is a threat detection service. Option E (Amazon Macie) is for data classification and protection.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain41_8',
  NOW(),
  45,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_41_3',
  'medium'
);

