  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Config) continuously monitors and records your AWS resource configurations, evaluating them against desired configurations and compliance rules. Option B (AWS Audit Manager) helps you continuously audit your AWS usage to simplify how you assess risk and compliance with regulations and industry standards. It automates evidence collection. Option C (AWS Security Hub) aggregates findings but is not primarily for audit evidence collection. Option D (Amazon Inspector) is for vulnerability scanning. Option E (AWS IAM Access Analyzer) identifies external access and unused permissions.',
