  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To set up AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter, the first step is to enable OpsCenter in your AWS account (Option B). Next, grant the necessary IAM permissions (Option D) to other AWS services (like CloudWatch or Config) so they can create OpsItems in OpsCenter. Then, configure Amazon EventBridge rules (Option A) to capture relevant events from these services and route them to OpsCenter. Finally, define OpsItem templates (Option C) to standardize the information captured and the recommended response actions for different types of operational issues.',
