  '{1,3,2,0}',
  'To set up an Amazon SNS topic, you first create the topic itself (Option B). Next, you configure access policies to control who can publish messages to the topic and who can subscribe to it (Option D). Then, you subscribe various endpoints, such as email addresses or AWS Lambda functions, to the topic to receive notifications (Option C). Finally, once the topic and subscriptions are set up, you can publish messages to the Amazon SNS topic, which will then be delivered to all subscribed endpoints (Option A).',
