  '{1,2,3,0}',
  'To implement an SNS and SQS fan-out pattern, you first create a single Amazon SNS topic (Option B). Next, you create multiple Amazon SQS queues, each representing a different consumer that needs to receive the event (Option C). Then, you subscribe each of these Amazon SQS queues to the Amazon SNS topic (Option D). Finally, you configure your publisher application or service to send messages to the Amazon SNS topic, which will then fan out to all subscribed SQS queues (Option A).',
