  '{0,1,3,2}',
  'To configure an Amazon EventBridge custom event bus, you first create the custom event bus itself within the EventBridge console (Option A). Next, you configure resource policies on this custom event bus to grant permissions to other AWS accounts or services to publish events to it (Option B). Then, you create rules on the custom event bus to define how incoming events should be processed and routed to targets (Option D). Finally, you can publish your custom events to this new event bus, which will then be processed by the defined rules (Option C).',
