  'q_40_m_40_1_112',
  'A DevOps team needs to set up a simple event-driven architecture where specific events from an AWS service are captured and sent to a target for processing. Order the steps to configure an Amazon EventBridge rule to achieve this with the LEAST operational overhead.',
