  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To configure an Amazon EventBridge rule, the first step is to create the rule itself (Option B). Once the rule exists, you define the event pattern (Option A) that EventBridge will use to filter incoming events. After the pattern is set, you select the appropriate target (Option C) where the matched events will be sent. Finally, you enable the rule (Option D) to activate it and begin routing events. This sequence ensures a logical setup for event processing.',
