  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'To define an escalation plan in AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager, you first create individual contacts within Incident Manager (Option C). Next, you specify the contact channels for each contact, such as email addresses or SMS numbers, so they can be reached (Option A). Then, you define the sequence of these contacts and the delay between each escalation step (e.g., notify Contact A, wait 5 minutes, then notify Contact B) (Option B). Finally, you add this newly created escalation plan to a response plan, which will use it during an incident (Option D).',
