  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To create a runbook for automated incident response, you first create an AWS Systems Manager Automation document (Option B). Next, you specify any parameters required for the runbook, such as resource IDs or action types (Option D). Then, you define the actual steps of the automation within the Systems Manager Automation document, outlining the actions to be performed (Option A). Finally, you link this Automation document to an AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager response plan, allowing it to be executed during an incident (Option C).',
