  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To create a custom dashboard in AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter, you first navigate to AWS Systems Manager OpsCenter in the console (Option B). Next, you choose ''Create dashboard'' and provide a descriptive name for your new dashboard (Option C). Then, you add various widgets to display OpsItem metrics (e.g., open OpsItems by severity) or lists of OpsItems (Option A). Finally, you can customize the layout and refresh interval of the dashboard to suit your monitoring needs (Option D).',
