  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To create an incident template in AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager, you first navigate to AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager in the console (Option B). Next, you choose ''Incident templates'' from the left navigation pane and then select ''Create template'' (Option D). Then, you define pre-populated fields for incident details such as title, impact, and summary, to standardize incident creation (Option A). Finally, you associate this template with a specific response plan, ensuring that incidents created from this template automatically use the correct response workflow (Option C).',
