  'To configure a contact in AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager, you first navigate to AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager in the console (Option B). Next, you choose ''Contacts'' from the navigation pane and then select ''Create contact'' (Option D). Then, you specify the contact details, including their name and an optional alias (Option A). Finally, you add one or more engagement channels, such as email or SMS, through which Incident Manager can notify this contact (Option C).',
