  '{3,0,1,2}',
  'To enable AWS Security Hub, you must first ensure the necessary IAM permissions are in place (Option D). Then, you enable Security Hub in the specific AWS Region (Option A). After activation, you should review and enable the security standards you want to use, such as the AWS Foundational Security Best Practices (Option B). Finally, if operating in a multi-account environment, you would configure finding aggregation across accounts, typically managed through AWS Organizations (Option C).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain41_8',
  NOW(),
  1,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_41_2',
  'easy'
