  'Before enabling, ensure the necessary IAM permissions for GuardDuty''s service-linked role are implicitly or explicitly available (Option D). The primary step to activate Amazon GuardDuty is to enable it in the AWS Management Console or via the AWS CLI (Option B). Once enabled, you can optionally configure trusted IP lists and threat lists to customize detection behavior (Option C). Finally, you would regularly review and manage the security findings generated by GuardDuty (Option A).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain41_8',
