  '{1,3,2,0}',
  'To encrypt S3 data with KMS, you first create a customer managed key (CMK) in AWS KMS (Option B). Then, you must grant the necessary IAM permissions for Amazon S3 to use this KMS key for encryption and decryption (Option D). Next, you configure the S3 bucket''s default encryption settings to use the newly created KMS key (Option C). Finally, when you upload objects to this S3 bucket, they will be encrypted at rest using the specified KMS key (Option A).',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain41_8',
