  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To effectively enable and configure AWS Security Hub, the first step is to enable AWS Security Hub in the primary aggregation Region (Option B). Once enabled, you should enable a security standard like CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark (Option A) to start evaluating resources against best practices. Next, configure cross-account aggregation to collect findings from member accounts (Option C), which is crucial for centralized monitoring in a multi-account environment. Finally, review and prioritize findings in the Security Hub console (Option D) to take appropriate action.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain41_8',
  NOW(),
  19,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_41_2',
  'medium'
