  '{0,2,3,1}',
  'To integrate Amazon GuardDuty findings with AWS Security Hub, you must first enable Amazon GuardDuty in the desired AWS Region (Option A). Concurrently, ensure AWS Security Hub is enabled in the same AWS Region (Option C), as both services need to be active for integration. GuardDuty automatically sends findings to Security Hub once both are enabled. The next step is to verify the GuardDuty integration is active in Security Hub''s Integrations page (Option D) to confirm data flow. Finally, review GuardDuty findings in the Security Hub console (Option B) to monitor security alerts.',
