  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To achieve continuous compliance with conformance packs, first define the conformance pack (Option A) by creating a YAML template that outlines the specific AWS Config rules and potential remediation actions. Next, deploy this conformance pack (Option B) across the target accounts and regions using AWS CloudFormation StackSets for scalable deployment. After deployment, monitor the compliance status (Option C) of resources against the conformance pack rules directly in the AWS Config console. Finally, implement automated remediation actions (Option D) for any non-compliant resources, as pre-defined within the conformance pack, to maintain continuous compliance.',
