  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To automate audit evidence collection, first select the appropriate compliance framework (Option A) within AWS Audit Manager that matches the audit''s requirements. Next, create a new assessment (Option B) in Audit Manager, defining the scope of AWS accounts and services from which evidence will be collected. Then, configure the data sources and controls (Option C) within the assessment to precisely align with the specific audit requirements. Finally, generate the audit report (Option D), which consolidates all collected evidence into a structured document suitable for auditors.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain41_8',
  NOW(),
  44,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_41_3',
  'hard'
);

