VALUES (
  'q_41_m_41_3_111',
  'A DevOps team is adopting a GitOps approach for infrastructure deployments and wants to ensure that all CloudFormation templates committed to the repository adhere to organizational security policies before deployment. They need to integrate policy-as-code checks into their CI/CD pipeline. Order the steps to integrate CloudFormation Guard into a CI/CD pipeline for IaC compliance.',
