  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To integrate CloudFormation Guard into a CI/CD pipeline, first develop the CloudFormation templates (Option A) that define the desired infrastructure. Next, write CloudFormation Guard rules (Option B) that codify the organizational security and compliance policies. Then, add a step to the CI/CD pipeline (Option C) to execute CloudFormation Guard, scanning the templates against these rules. Finally, configure the pipeline to fail the build (Option D) and prevent deployment if any Guard rules are violated, ensuring only compliant infrastructure is provisioned.',
