  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To deploy an AWS Config conformance pack, the initial step is to prepare a YAML template defining the conformance pack rules and remediation actions (Option B). This template specifies the desired compliance checks. Next, deploy the conformance pack using the AWS Config console or AWS CLI (Option C), which will provision the Config rules. After deployment, review the compliance status of resources against the conformance pack rules (Option A) to see initial evaluations. Finally, monitor the conformance pack for non-compliant resources and findings (Option D) to ensure ongoing compliance and address any deviations.',
